cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this reproducibility package, please cite the associated article and this archived software release."
title: "Benchmark-Validity Audit for ISOT and FakeNewsNet"
type: software
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-31
authors:
  - family-names: Chellali
    given-names: Sara
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4533-2741"
    affiliation: "Ecole Normale Supérieure, Laghouat, Algeria"
  - family-names: Kired
    given-names: Affaf
    affiliation: "Ecole Normale Supérieure, Laghouat, Algeria"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible scripts, protocols, aggregate results, and text-free item-level
  predictions for auditing leakage, duplicate groups, source-label
  association, temporal validity, probability calibration, model tuning, and
  cross-corpus transfer in TF-IDF classifiers trained on ISOT and evaluated on
  FakeNewsNet–PolitiFact and GossipCop. Version 1.1.0 adds complete group-aware
  internal-validation, leakage-controlled chronological-evaluation, and nested
  calibration-transfer workflows.
keywords:
  - fake news detection
  - external validation
  - dataset shift
  - construct validity
  - reproducibility
  - TF-IDF
  - calibration
  - chronological evaluation
  - group-aware validation
license: MIT
